	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Binas a te, optime compater, literas heri sub ves<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>peram accepi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Posterioribus multis excusas priorum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>subitaneam festinantiam; ego vero, si quid ea in re peccatum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>esset, merito condonarem, ut qui omnes mea <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>literas exarem et festinantissime et pessime, ut re<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vera dicere possim me esse cacographum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Caeterum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>veniam merentur et festinantes et multis intricati <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>negociis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nunc quoque atramentum meum ita crassum est, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ut vehementer impediat festinare cupientem; si <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>aqua dilicuero, aqua verius quam atramento scribere <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>videar.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Non est autem, cur tuis ordine et pro<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>lixe respondeam; paucis ergo accipe.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vocavi meos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>generos, exposui, quae mihi scripsisti de nepote d. <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName>Augustini a Salice</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName>Ludovicus</persName> habet <placeName>Gallisantem</placeName> e<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>t <placeName>Germanicam</placeName> discentem linguam; nihil autem pro<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ficiunt in lingua, cum tales coniunguntur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName>Zwinglius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>plures prope convictores habet, quam velit; in turba <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vero tanta huiusmodi pueris non consulitur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Iosias <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et ipse habet suas excusationes non iniustas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hunc <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>misi ad d. <persName>Ioannem Kolerum</persName> perquisitum, num ipse recip<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>eret talem puerum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Respondit se accepturum, attamen no<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>n minori precio quam florenorum 30, quod <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quidem mihi videtur satis amplum esse.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nihil aliud <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nunc potui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Heri sub vesperam mihi tuae sunt <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>reddita.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scis hodierna me concionari, deinde solito <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>plus invisi et turbari a multis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">At iam reddenda<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>e fuerunt literae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Ich wil hernach wyter nach<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>vrag haben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Soliche junge knaben bedörfftend <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>trüwer lüten, die inen guts thätend und nit bald <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>verdrüssig wurdent.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Solicitum me habet et reddit, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quoties huc studiosi veniunt, quibus hospites in<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quirere iubeor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Mallem alios hoc facere, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>plus esset ocii minusque curarum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quae habemus hic <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>nova, in chartam illita mitto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis d. <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>consulem, d. <persName>Philippum</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontasellam</persName> et amicos, inprimis <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderychum a Salice</persName>, cui nova communicabis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Significabis et hoc illum clarissimum virum d. d. <persName>Conradum <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Gessnerum</persName> postulare, ut, si quam habeat, descriptionem <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>thermarum <placeName>Wormensium</placeName> vel <placeName>Bromiarum</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z49"/><foreign xml:lang="de">des Wormserbadts</foreign>, ipsi benigne communicet.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Omnia <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>felicia ipsi precatur et gratum se fore pollicetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z51"/>Dominus benedicat tibi et familiae tuae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>5. novembris 1557.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te et tuos mei <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>omnes.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z54"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, compatri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et fratri meo charissimo.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Dem herren pfarrer <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>zuͦ Sant Martin zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
